00:05:23.968 --> 00:05:27.234
-See you upstairs, Kelvin.

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:30.234
-And daddy's
closest work acquaintances.

00:05:30.234 --> 00:05:32.667
-There you go.
Adam Devine, everybody.

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:35.200
Season two
of "The Righteous Gemstones"

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:39.467
